      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edgeworth%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "From its early days, Edgeworth became a bedroom community for Pittsburgh managers and professionals seeking cleaner air.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
